<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβο-άω</span></b> , late fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βοήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.2.2
				</span></i>
			:—<i>proclaim, publish,</i>
			aor.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βοάσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					638
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): c. acc. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖσε χωρεῖν τινὰς διεβοήσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be the common talk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα δὴ διαβεβόηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					312b
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be celebrated,</i> of persons or things, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Them.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Per.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nec.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				12.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cry aloud,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.53
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>contend in shouting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				26.19
			</span></i>.</div>
